menu "Calculator Application"

    config BROOKESIA_APP_CALCULATOR_ROUND_DISPLAY
        bool "Lay out the Calculator for a round display"
        default y
        help
            Enable on boards with a circular panel, such as the XC 3.4C
            (800x800) and 4C (720x720). The display and the round keys are
            then sized to stay inside the visible circle. Only applies when
            the panel is square; disable on rectangular panels to keep the
            plain rectangular layout.

endmenu
